  "description": "CR 614.1c / 122.1c / 608.2c: Sanctuary Warden enters with two shield counters; its enters trigger lets alice remove a counter from a creature or planeswalker she controls, and if she does, she draws a card and creates a 1/1 green and white Citizen; a second Warden's trigger she declines, and nothing follows.",
